### Codex Wise Tool Workflow

1. Start with `get_overview()`.
2. Ask targeted questions with `get_answer(question="...")`.
3. Fetch context before edits with `get_context(targets=["path/or/module"])`.
4. Check blast radius with `get_risk(targets=["path/to/file"])`.
5. Locate code with `search_codebase(query="...")`.
6. Review rationale with `get_why(query="...")`.
7. Review cleanup candidates with `get_dead_code()`.
